From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 07:10:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ports/arkweb: Optional network proxy for on-device testing

The dev board has no direct network route, so read an HTTP(S) proxy URI
from the web.engine.servo.proxy system param and set Servo's proxy prefs.
Combined with an `hdc rport` reverse-forward to a host proxy, live
http/https URLs load through the development host. tools/dev_proxy.py is
that host proxy.

Validation: Test by setting the web.engine.servo.proxy param with ports/arkweb/tools/dev_proxy.py and loading an external URL on device.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; implementation and on-device testing)
